# Files/dirs in the repo root that are NOT stow packages.
# `stow */` from the repo root will still try to treat every dir as a package,
# so keep non-package dirs out of stow runs by listing them here or by being
# explicit about which packages to stow (see bootstrap.sh).
\.git
\.github
\.idea
\.gitignore
\.stow-local-ignore
README\.md
bootstrap\.sh
Makefile
LICENSE
omnishell
shell\.d
rootloops
